### Lista JSON: prima cerere MISS, următoarea HIT (în 5 secunde)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/employees
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: intellij-demo-1

### XML
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/employees
Accept: application/xml

### Format nesuportat: 406
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/employees
Accept: text/csv

### Round Robin: repetați și urmăriți X-Warehouse
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/employees
Cache-Control: no-cache

### Creare 201, repetare 200
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=4&name=Alexandra

### Cache invalidat, date actualizate
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/employees

### Propunere: 202
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=4&name=Alexandra%20Manea

### Pull propuneri
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/updates/employees?after=0

### Confirmare prin PUT
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=4&name=Alexandra%20Manea

### Health proxy
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/health
